{"ref":"BDB, עֹ֫שֶׁק","hw":"עֹ֫שֶׁק","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עֹ֫שֶׁק</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:7\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.7\">Ec 7:7</a> <strong>oppression, extortion</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.6\">Je 6:6</a> +, cstr. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:134\" href=\"/Psalms.119.134\">ψ 119:134</a> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 5:7\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.5.7\">Ec 5:7</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.6\">Je 6:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.17\">22:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.7\">Ez 22:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.12\">12</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:8\" href=\"/Psalms.73.8\">ψ 73:8</a>; c. genit. subj. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:134\" href=\"/Psalms.119.134\">119:134</a>, obj. <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 5:7\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.5.7\">Ec 5:7</a>; as acc. cogn. c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָשַׁק</span> (q.v.) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:18\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.18\">Ez 18:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.29\">22:29</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  national <em>oppression</em>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 54:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.54.14\">Is 54:14</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  concr., <em>gain of extortion</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 62:11\" href=\"/Psalms.62.11\">ψ 62:11</a>, so perhaps <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 7:7\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.7.7\">Ec 7:7</a>; as acc. cogn. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 5:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.5.23\">Lv 5:23</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּזֵל</span>).—<a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.12\">Is 30:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.13\">59:13</a> read <span dir=\"rtl\">עִקֵּשׁ</span> Lag Gr al.","next":"BDB, עֵ֫שֶׁק","prev":"BDB, עָשַׁק"}